<BaseLayout
  title="Bamboo Flooring: China Factory Wholesale"
  keywords="bamboo flooring, china, factory, wholesale"
  description="Bothbest is a China factory manufacturing bamboo flooring and offers bamboo flooring price in wholesale, guaranteed quality, worldwide shipping."
  bodyClass="html front not-logged-in no-sidebars page-node"
  footerType="home"
  rssUrl="/rss/products.xml"
>
    <section class="prescript taglineWrap">
        <form action="/search.aspx" method="get" class="MobileSearch">
            <input type="text" name="MobileSearchKeywords" id="MobileSearchKeywords" />
            <input type="submit" id="MobileSearch" name="MobileSearch" value="Search" class="form-submit" />
        </form>
        <div class="container">
            <div id="block-views-mentor-slider-block" class="block block-views">
                <div class="view view-mentor-slider view-id-mentor_slider view-display-id-block sliderWrap view-dom-id-82b87b009e03cbc82207b8d79bdd69cb">
                    <div class="view-content">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="span12">
                                <div class="peVolo">
                                    <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p1epfv1i6adqjbc6pksmgappl1.jpg" alt="Happy New Year" title="Happy New Year" /></div>
                                    <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p1epfv114317ktc78jf9ikei2i1.jpg" alt="Bothbest Bamboo Flooring" title="Bothbest Bamboo Flooring" /></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container mainContent">
        <div class="row-fluid">
            <div class="tabs"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-fluid">
            <div class="content span12 ">
                <a id="main-content"></a>
                <div id="block-block-6" class="block block-block">
                    <div class="row-fluid featuredContent">
                        <div class="span4">
                            <h1><span class="btn btn-inverse">01</span> Who we are</h1>
                            <p>Bothbest is a FSC certified bamboo factory based in China, manufacturing bamboo flooring, decking and plywood since 2001, selling bamboo worldwidely, gaining a good reputation, providing one-stop purchasing service of bamboo, from indoor to outdoor, from ground to ceiling.<br /><br />Bothbest has been recognized as a reliable, trustable, preferred bamboo supplier and is pleased to work with importers, distributors, designers, architects, contractors and builders from all over the world.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="span4">
                            <h1><span class="btn btn-inverse">02</span> What we have</h1>
                            <p>Bothbest offers widest varieties, consistent quality, unbeatable pricing of bamboo, including flooring, decking, panels, plywood, veneer, lumber, mats, cabinets, countertop, fence, pole and related creative bamboo. All of our bamboo have been CE certified to be environmental and healthy.<br /><br />Bamboo flooring includes solid, strand woven, click and engineered. Decking includes standard, xtra and black color. Panels thickness is from 3mm to 80mm. Mats include various dimensions.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="span4">
                            <h1><span class="btn btn-inverse">03</span> Why choose us</h1>
                            <p>Bamboo is considered as sustainable and renewable resource due to the plant‘s rapid growth. As a grass, bamboo is mature and ready to be harvested in 4-6 years compared to hardwood which requires 25 years to grow. Bamboo can grow as much as 24 inches in 24 hours.<br /><br />Bothbest is an experienced and helpful flooring expert, providing quality guaranteed bamboo products and outstanding customer service. You save by buying direct from the manufacturer.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-fluid">
                        <div class="divider dotted clearfix"><span></span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="bamboo" class="block block-block">
                    <h1>Hottest Bamboo</h1>
                    <div class="row-fluid featuredContent">
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119144871334.jpg" alt="solid bamboo flooring" title="solid bamboo flooring" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Solid Bamboo Flooring</h4><p>Solid bamboo flooring comes in 4 basic varieties, is made strictly from 100% renewable resource - bamboo, tongue and groove, largest sales on bamboo. Stained colors available to achieve demands.<a href="/products/solid-bamboo-flooring.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119152256770.jpg" alt="wide plank bamboo flooring" title="wide plank bamboo flooring" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Wide Plank Bamboo Floorin...</h4><p>Wide plank bamboo flooring is long and wide plank, 3-layer cross laminated, providing highest stability, requiring fewer planks compared than classic bamboo, having fast installation.<a href="/products/wide-plank-bamboo-flooring.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119155711237.jpg" alt="strand bamboo flooring" title="strand bamboo flooring" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Strand Woven Bamboo Floor...</h4><p>Strand woven bamboo is the fastest growing segment of bamboo sales, the most expensive, most durable, highest density, hardest, commercial grade and excellent hardness of bamboo flooring.<a href="/products/strand-woven-bamboo-flooring.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119163454583.jpg" alt="click strand bamboo flooring" title="click strand bamboo flooring" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Click Strand Bamboo Floor...</h4><p>Click strand woven bamboo flooring, our premium offering, combines beauty, strength, durability, replicates the grain of traditional hardwood. DIY flooring, glue-less and fast installation.<a href="/products/click-strand-woven-bamboo-flooring.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119190363525.jpg" alt="bamboo veneer" title="bamboo veneer" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Bamboo Veneer</h4><p>Bamboo veneer is sliced from rapidly renewable resources bamboo blocks, exotic and green material for replacement of wood veneer, longer and wider sheet, greater hardness, easier processing.<a href="/products/bamboo-veneer.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                        <div class="span3"><img src="/img/ThumbPic/2014103119183766759.jpg" alt="bamboo plywood" title="bamboo plywood" /></div>
                        <div class="span3"><h4>Bamboo Plywood</h4><p>Bamboo plywood is an additional name of bamboo panels in USA, laminated by layers of finest bamboo strips with eco-friendly adhesive, flexible dimensions, multiple applications, custom sizes.<a href="/products/bamboo-plywood.html"><span class="label">More</span></a></p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-fluid">
                        <div class="divider dotted clearfix"><span></span></div>
                    </div>
