                                <div data-delay="5"><div class="portfolioItem"><a href="/products/bamboo-flooring-high-gloss-carbonized.html" class="peOver"><img typeof="foaf:Image" src="/img/ThumbPic/2021012208281913633.jpg" width="480" height="396" alt="Flat Press Carbonized Solid Bamboo Flooring" title="Flat Press Carbonized Solid Bamboo Flooring" /><span></span></a><p>Solid Bamboo Flooring High Gloss Carbonzied</p></div></div>
